<title>SPAIN: Spain's Bankinter cuts prime rate.</title>
<headline>Spain's Bankinter cuts prime rate.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1996-12-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Spanish bank Bankinter said on Friday it cut its prime rate to 6.25 percent from 6.75 percent after the Bank of Spain cut its key money market rate 50 basis points to 6.25 percent.</p>
<p>-- Madrid newsroom +341 585 2160</p>
</text>
